msgid ""
"Expense sheet \"%(sheet)s\" is now \"%(state)s\" in Odoo but the status "
"could not be sent to OkTicket (action %(action)s): %(reason)s. Both sides "
"are out of sync until someone fixes it by hand."
msgstr ""
"La hoja de gastos \"%(sheet)s\" está ahora en \"%(state)s\" en Odoo pero el "
"estado no se ha podido enviar a OkTicket (acción %(action)s): %(reason)s. "
"Las dos partes quedan desincronizadas hasta que alguien lo corrija a mano."

#. module: okticket_connector_hr_expense_sheet
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/okticket_connector_hr_expense_sheet/models/okticket_hr_expense_sheet.py:0
msgid ""
"Expense sheet report %(report)s: %(linked)s of %(total)s expenses linked in "
"OkTicket. The other %(refused)s were refused and stay on the Odoo sheet "
"without their OkTicket counterpart, so the two sides differ for those lines."
" OkTicket ids: %(ids)s. First reason: %(reason)s"
msgstr ""
"Informe de hoja de gastos %(report)s: %(linked)s de %(total)s gastos "
"vinculados en OkTicket. Los otros %(refused)s fueron rechazados y se quedan "
"en la hoja de Odoo sin su contrapartida en OkTicket, así que las dos partes "
"difieren en esas líneas. Ids de OkTicket: %(ids)s. Primer motivo: %(reason)s"

